On Mon, Oct 31, 2016 at 10:51 AM, David Sommerseth <openvpn@...2142...
topphemmelig.net> wrote:

> I was not aware it was fixed in the 2.4 branch until today.
>

> But this is still an issue with 2.3.  That's what I believe should be
> fixed, as that is considered at least a missing feature there.
>

The feature request is for username from file, password from GUI. That is
not supported in any versions and the limitation comes from openvpn itself,
not the GUI.

Users who have "auth-user-pass file" with only username in file and using
the GUI will not see any password prompt in any version including
2.4-alpha2.

Selva

